[{:db/id "q-316756/field-1/748ace1880a8a684b08cbd6d1e3758f92ec147ef77595b72c0734e079eb36c7d" :answer/id #uuid "f6c51f5e-9ea1-5090-b338-c69782947ed6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{61}{37}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316756/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "1160c31f-010b-51da-8482-5c4ac67318e0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316756/field-1/748ace1880a8a684b08cbd6d1e3758f92ec147ef77595b72c0734e079eb36c7d" :answer-field/choices ["q-316756/field-1/748ace1880a8a684b08cbd6d1e3758f92ec147ef77595b72c0734e079eb36c7d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316756/field-2/0d3c1c83f87b69ef4f4e945040843f1af521e0eaa8ca14b4abf5632cbe25f12b" :answer/id #uuid "df7951f5-b418-52aa-8fcf-1d31709708f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{4}{37}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316756/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "d792d74a-f591-5bbd-a83d-135f0127fa08" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316756/field-2/0d3c1c83f87b69ef4f4e945040843f1af521e0eaa8ca14b4abf5632cbe25f12b" :answer-field/choices ["q-316756/field-2/0d3c1c83f87b69ef4f4e945040843f1af521e0eaa8ca14b4abf5632cbe25f12b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316756" :question/id #uuid "6645a6eb-e0b8-5183-8e27-1ebca6dc4649" :question/math-academy-id "q-316756" :question/problem "Evaluate the expression below, expressing your answer in the form $a+b\\text{i},$ where $a$ and $b$ are real numbers.\n\n$\\frac{12-19\\text{i}}{8-11\\text{i}}=($\n{{field-1}} \n$)\\,+\\,($\n{{field-2}}\n$)\\,\\text{i}$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator is $8-11\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $8+11\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $8+11\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{12-19\\text{i}}{8-11\\text{i}} & =\\frac{12-19\\text{i}}{8-11\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{8+11\\text{i}}{8+11\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(12-19\\text{i})(8+11\\text{i})}{(8-11\\text{i})(8+11\\text{i})} \\\\  & =\\frac{96+132\\text{i}-152\\text{i}-209{\\text{i}}^{2}}{{8}^{2}-(11\\text{i})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{96-20\\text{i}-209(-1)}{{8}^{2}+{11}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{96-20\\text{i}+209}{64+121} \\\\  & =\\frac{305-20\\text{i}}{185} \\\\  & =\\frac{5(61-4\\text{i})}{5\\cdot 37} \\\\  & =\\frac{61-4\\text{i}}{37}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{61-4\\text{i}}{37}=(\\frac{61}{37})+(-\\frac{4}{37})\\,\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316756/field-1" "q-316756/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "64d7a092-1997-5305-b44c-47c41bc9ac57"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316756"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-16431/selection/dee1d7d6852c092ca984cfcb4365ece9a07ecec4913585ee27f4c748dfc549d1" :answer/id #uuid "5cd81767-a04b-5381-81a1-848eab34480e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{25}{73}+\\frac{55}{73}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-16431/selection/145dfbb443570efce68f2b5898f09dfc697fee519ba2f0421f163c3cc36d7e0d" :answer/id #uuid "21181676-9821-5fca-a4c7-cdbecac52c7a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{25}{73}-\\frac{55}{73}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-16431/selection/35ddf3960ba0c6f01d0bd1170f67425ffbb29ef78918df37ae2e338493c6deba" :answer/id #uuid "7e050e12-15ef-521c-9e98-aa24f5b5c83c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{73}{25}+\\frac{55}{73}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-16431/selection/712cc167b690616c7e8ef10863a0139bd9d228356fafd98fdccb03c2e6561b33" :answer/id #uuid "f78a6cbf-308c-5344-9a3e-553549aec8d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{73}{25}-\\frac{55}{73}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-16431/selection/3f2769b098e025ac29e8023c7ee9243dba7a6e3fab3857e3e304d3907fa5bb15" :answer/id #uuid "081d7988-6036-5ed1-a0f7-26b830384945" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{25}{73}-\\frac{55}{73}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-16431/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "55766db4-24ff-57bf-a0a6-f2e5ad675fe8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-16431/selection/3f2769b098e025ac29e8023c7ee9243dba7a6e3fab3857e3e304d3907fa5bb15" :answer-field/choices ["q-16431/selection/dee1d7d6852c092ca984cfcb4365ece9a07ecec4913585ee27f4c748dfc549d1" "q-16431/selection/145dfbb443570efce68f2b5898f09dfc697fee519ba2f0421f163c3cc36d7e0d" "q-16431/selection/35ddf3960ba0c6f01d0bd1170f67425ffbb29ef78918df37ae2e338493c6deba" "q-16431/selection/712cc167b690616c7e8ef10863a0139bd9d228356fafd98fdccb03c2e6561b33" "q-16431/selection/3f2769b098e025ac29e8023c7ee9243dba7a6e3fab3857e3e304d3907fa5bb15"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-16431" :question/id #uuid "8c6c84e8-7668-521a-a164-5f636d19f963" :question/math-academy-id "q-16431" :question/problem "if ${z}_{1}=5+5\\text{i}$ and ${z}_{2}=-3+8\\text{i}$, then ${z}_{1}$ divided by ${z}_{2}$ equals" :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the fraction:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5+5\\text{i}}{-3+8\\text{i}}\n$$\n\nThe denominator is $-3+8\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $-3-8\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $-3-8\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{z}_{1}}{{z}_{2}} & =\\frac{5+5\\text{i}}{-3+8\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{5+5\\text{i}}{-3+8\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{-3-8\\text{i}}{-3-8\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-15-40\\text{i}-15\\text{i}-40{\\text{i}}^{2}}{{3}^{2}-{8}^{2}{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-15-55\\text{i}-40(-1)}{{3}^{2}+{8}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-15-55\\text{i}+40}{9+64} \\\\  & =\\frac{25-55\\text{i}}{73}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{25-55\\text{i}}{73}=\\frac{25}{73}-\\frac{55}{73}\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-16431/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "64d7a092-1997-5305-b44c-47c41bc9ac57"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-16431"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-167671/selection/80224bbeb110e510ffb6f486b8a55f9f05374343687865c2a8296e259f319f62" :answer/id #uuid "d7e8e09b-d9f2-53a8-9f1f-a6c34fc677ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5-\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-167671/selection/928bcc42113422a1db9c741fe39f0ce76b2ca9ab809b959b39b515c828dde3d9" :answer/id #uuid "f421e28e-4506-5d29-b26d-d312e88b94ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{3}+\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-167671/selection/b3a081be68f5c4e5075689374e3536b1bc45cb4ae5a190725b737fb0922b3ddd" :answer/id #uuid "5ac094ca-405d-5da2-a094-42adbba2b0cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{7}{3}-\\frac{2}{3}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-167671/selection/d6e4074e93e044c1e3a03d7bc9fc7f73338698710d15de3b2a9be083ccfa3094" :answer/id #uuid "d4fb8eef-e80a-581a-8a29-dd8e301b8064" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}-\\frac{12}{5}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-167671/selection/9df87dc2690494ad4cc5f140760a8c163eec68c23e6ec3cf0c3dd83587d411e5" :answer/id #uuid "a343e7d9-cb8b-5f64-ab4e-8391a3d15ad4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{4}{5}+\\frac{2}{5}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-167671/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ebddbc4b-84d6-5efe-896d-eba96a7a5e01" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-167671/selection/d6e4074e93e044c1e3a03d7bc9fc7f73338698710d15de3b2a9be083ccfa3094" :answer-field/choices ["q-167671/selection/80224bbeb110e510ffb6f486b8a55f9f05374343687865c2a8296e259f319f62" "q-167671/selection/928bcc42113422a1db9c741fe39f0ce76b2ca9ab809b959b39b515c828dde3d9" "q-167671/selection/b3a081be68f5c4e5075689374e3536b1bc45cb4ae5a190725b737fb0922b3ddd" "q-167671/selection/d6e4074e93e044c1e3a03d7bc9fc7f73338698710d15de3b2a9be083ccfa3094" "q-167671/selection/9df87dc2690494ad4cc5f140760a8c163eec68c23e6ec3cf0c3dd83587d411e5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-167671" :question/id #uuid "4ff7ffb7-e3d5-54df-983e-2a539ba75182" :question/math-academy-id "q-167671" :question/problem "$\\frac{5-2\\text{i}}{1+2\\text{i}}=$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator is $1+2\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $1-2\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $1-2\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5-2\\text{i}}{1+2\\text{i}} & =\\frac{5-2\\text{i}}{1+2\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{1-2\\text{i}}{1-2\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{5-10\\text{i}-2\\text{i}+4{\\text{i}}^{2}}{{1}^{2}-{2}^{2}{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{5-12\\text{i}+4(-1)}{1-4(-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{5-12\\text{i}-4}{1+4} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-12\\text{i}}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1-12\\text{i}}{5}=\\frac{1}{5}-\\frac{12}{5}\\text{i}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-167671/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "64d7a092-1997-5305-b44c-47c41bc9ac57"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-167671"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-964"] :question/problem "If ${z}_{1}=2-5\\text{i}$ and ${z}_{2}=6+3\\text{i}$, then ${z}_{1}$ divided by ${z}_{2}$ equals" :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the fraction:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2-5\\text{i}}{6+3\\text{i}}\n$$\n\nThe denominator is $6+3\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $6-3\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $6-3\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{z}_{1}}{{z}_{2}} & =\\frac{2-5\\text{i}}{6+3\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2-5\\text{i}}{6+3\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{6-3\\text{i}}{6-3\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{12-6\\text{i}-30\\text{i}+15{\\text{i}}^{2}}{{6}^{2}-{3}^{2}{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{12-36\\text{i}+15(-1)}{{6}^{2}+{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{12-36\\text{i}-15}{36+9} \\\\  & =\\frac{-3-36\\text{i}}{45}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-3-36\\text{i}}{45}=-\\frac{3}{45}-\\frac{36}{45}\\text{i}=-\\frac{1}{15}-\\frac{4}{5}\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-316848/field-1/ea886782f883139045e5abc122fc35c608bfcc0ac4d51b469ff658e915045408" :answer/id #uuid "e4087cb9-6485-532d-a03a-6bccbef0a9d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7}{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186265138 :answer-field/choices ["q-316848/field-1/ea886782f883139045e5abc122fc35c608bfcc0ac4d51b469ff658e915045408"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316851/field-1/12712209e9706bd8bdfedccf745e34551dea36e02584e5247b27990c1697d42c" :answer/id #uuid "50ef3393-d193-5938-a98f-61e8b6252185" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{15}{13}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316851/field-1/4beac40be125df285f94d814b05265c6d87392bc3fc5802cfcf75e96a47b31b3" :answer/id #uuid "142e53ac-9713-5f68-8675-2fd5c2f6299e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{15}{13}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316851/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "9805af53-153b-5946-8eed-12848701eddc" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316851/field-1/12712209e9706bd8bdfedccf745e34551dea36e02584e5247b27990c1697d42c" :answer-field/choices ["q-316851/field-1/12712209e9706bd8bdfedccf745e34551dea36e02584e5247b27990c1697d42c" "q-316851/field-1/4beac40be125df285f94d814b05265c6d87392bc3fc5802cfcf75e96a47b31b3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316851/field-2/0e0b7f0c6ddc9443ebb52e486a1859bbf690930fb1e7c57cc7012d23ebdf96a7" :answer/id #uuid "4107bcb7-5471-52e6-b6b4-106d1dd6fb9f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{10}{13}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316851/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "5502af53-5b6f-57c4-acd0-9a1bce208373" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316851/field-2/0e0b7f0c6ddc9443ebb52e486a1859bbf690930fb1e7c57cc7012d23ebdf96a7" :answer-field/choices ["q-316851/field-2/0e0b7f0c6ddc9443ebb52e486a1859bbf690930fb1e7c57cc7012d23ebdf96a7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316851" :question/id #uuid "c2fcaadd-b7ff-5b19-b396-85cf3b042495" :question/math-academy-id "q-316851" :question/problem "Evaluate the expression below, expressing your answer in the form $a+b\\text{i},$ where $a$ and $b$ are real numbers.\n\n$\\frac{5\\text{i}}{-2+3\\text{i}}=($\n {{field-1}} \n$)\\,+\\,($\n{{field-2}}\n$)\\,\\text{i}$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator is $-2+3\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $-2-3\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $-2-3\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5\\text{i}}{-2+3\\text{i}} & =\\frac{5\\text{i}}{-2+3\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{-2-3\\text{i}}{-2-3\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-10\\text{i}-15{\\text{i}}^{2}}{(-2)^{2}-(3\\text{i})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-10\\text{i}-15(-1)}{4-(-9)} \\\\  & =\\frac{15-10\\text{i}}{13}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{15-10\\text{i}}{13}=(\\frac{15}{13})+(-\\frac{10}{13})\\,\\text{i}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316851/field-1" "q-316851/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "27da4eb7-48c8-58f4-9676-c88d659f5fbb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316851"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-167673/selection/94c4812229718848a8b35a00dc7232c5e365de9e268e2a7c463ce859f0ca2c3d" :answer/id #uuid "f11d785f-a32b-50f9-bfe3-3662de6b1113" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{5}+\\frac{6}{5}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-167673/selection/2b7cc7b00bac5e731a33329655b2882e6568ba37fec7c72df76c3d48aa477142" :answer/id #uuid "bee40c07-4dc5-5c21-8bb9-c48b098e4538" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{10}+\\frac{3}{10}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-167673/selection/3febadfbb13bbb9d132cd061e471f4661af15d4458ce9f21dfafde880d441c27" :answer/id #uuid "63f1e044-ab50-56cc-8347-c933894aa714" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}-\\frac{3}{8}i" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-167673/selection/3b014d02aeec5f279a773d50abafce649a9729d31522c3fd3b8ee53e39a2d8bc" :answer/id #uuid "36af84d1-4727-5a19-a086-57d2befa239d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{10}-\\frac{2}{5}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-167673/selection/942e1274a9ce9dc6e30b508a09c92b6b563af10536d4b507239905e41c69cec8" :answer/id #uuid "01863964-8869-5dcd-9b5f-e90a7fe7405e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}+\\frac{4}{5}i" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-167673/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "92741674-11d2-58e5-a2f2-f54029443ff3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-167673/selection/94c4812229718848a8b35a00dc7232c5e365de9e268e2a7c463ce859f0ca2c3d" :answer-field/choices ["q-167673/selection/94c4812229718848a8b35a00dc7232c5e365de9e268e2a7c463ce859f0ca2c3d" "q-167673/selection/2b7cc7b00bac5e731a33329655b2882e6568ba37fec7c72df76c3d48aa477142" "q-167673/selection/3febadfbb13bbb9d132cd061e471f4661af15d4458ce9f21dfafde880d441c27" "q-167673/selection/3b014d02aeec5f279a773d50abafce649a9729d31522c3fd3b8ee53e39a2d8bc" "q-167673/selection/942e1274a9ce9dc6e30b508a09c92b6b563af10536d4b507239905e41c69cec8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-167673" :question/id #uuid "4ada4b0f-8d44-546b-8352-178ace59db0a" :question/math-academy-id "q-167673" :question/problem "$\\frac{4\\text{i}}{3-\\text{i}}=$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator is $3-\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $3+\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $3+\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4\\text{i}}{3-\\text{i}} & =\\frac{4\\text{i}}{3-\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{3+\\text{i}}{3+\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\text{i}(3+\\text{i})}{{3}^{2}-{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{12\\text{i}+4{\\text{i}}^{2}}{{3}^{2}-(-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{12\\text{i}+4(-1)}{9+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{-4+12\\text{i}}{10}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-4+12\\text{i}}{10} & =-\\frac{4}{10}+\\frac{12}{10}\\text{i} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{5}+\\frac{6}{5}\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-167673/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "27da4eb7-48c8-58f4-9676-c88d659f5fbb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-167673"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-963"] :question/problem "$\\frac{3\\text{i}}{1+\\text{i}}=$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator is $1+\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $1-\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $1-\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3\\text{i}}{1+\\text{i}} & =\\frac{3\\text{i}}{1+\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{1-\\text{i}}{1-\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\text{i}-3{\\text{i}}^{2}}{{1}^{2}-{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\text{i}-3(-1)}{1-(-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\text{i}+3}{1+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\text{i}+3}{2}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3\\text{i}+3}{2}=\\frac{3}{2}+\\frac{3}{2}\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-316865/field-1/f548ca9826c3604e1639793e23da26ebc53dd9dfeb63a2af2c9a968b60bbfb21" :answer/id #uuid "e5a1987a-e8e8-5973-a87c-206ecd3b54fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{18}{13}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316865/field-1/3231f0e49ea7671cbf088de40a2dc9e07ea96b57d7f872c20e03035451ce2c0f" :answer/id #uuid "154c6c99-1a73-5bc5-b2dc-394a4b3bddc6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{18}{13}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316865/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8a5cad8b-af9a-54f8-a6a9-2bf939a5a1af" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316865/field-1/f548ca9826c3604e1639793e23da26ebc53dd9dfeb63a2af2c9a968b60bbfb21" :answer-field/choices ["q-316865/field-1/f548ca9826c3604e1639793e23da26ebc53dd9dfeb63a2af2c9a968b60bbfb21" "q-316865/field-1/3231f0e49ea7671cbf088de40a2dc9e07ea96b57d7f872c20e03035451ce2c0f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316865/field-2/7ce48957c13cbafdbde3c59b7102237d54bec504ad28dcba8b06917cdb6cc51d" :answer/id #uuid "d1032752-a306-5c1d-9534-5cacd8dba2e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{12}{13}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316865/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "4a11e05b-70a5-59bf-bfe2-5d8181d6a88e" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316865/field-2/7ce48957c13cbafdbde3c59b7102237d54bec504ad28dcba8b06917cdb6cc51d" :answer-field/choices ["q-316865/field-2/7ce48957c13cbafdbde3c59b7102237d54bec504ad28dcba8b06917cdb6cc51d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316865" :question/id #uuid "0c7e5472-5591-54bc-99e1-f49831819b85" :question/math-academy-id "q-316865" :question/problem "Evaluate the expression below, expressing your answer in the form $a+b\\text{i},$ where $a$ and $b$ are real numbers.\n\n$\\frac{-6}{3+2\\text{i}}=($\n {{field-1}} \n$)\\,+\\,($\n{{field-2}}\n$)\\,\\text{i}$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator is $3+2\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $3-2\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $3-2\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-6}{3+2\\text{i}} & =\\frac{-6}{3+2\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{3-2\\text{i}}{3-2\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-18+12\\text{i}}{{3}^{2}-(2\\text{i})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-18+12\\text{i}}{9-(-4)} \\\\  & =\\frac{-18+12\\text{i}}{13}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-18+12\\text{i}}{13}=(-\\frac{18}{13})+(\\frac{12}{13})\\,\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316865/field-1" "q-316865/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "678ba6cb-b259-5a25-858c-9db161a34ca9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316865"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-275375/field-1/edc901e84f0cdd5174afd49105ac3883566ea0e1e057217fb66083a56cc119ba" :answer/id #uuid "e586f5ec-00a0-5b8f-bca7-5733d5ee2832" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275375/field-1/c7e2c99672184a6ffc5fe21255ac37862a4c27e4b225c7b645ba47d8f3c76eda" :answer/id #uuid "dccdf72c-3779-5a46-a74e-92b967360df5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275375/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "7c706a72-b105-5a8f-861f-7c2794bcfe2f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275375/field-1/edc901e84f0cdd5174afd49105ac3883566ea0e1e057217fb66083a56cc119ba" :answer-field/choices ["q-275375/field-1/edc901e84f0cdd5174afd49105ac3883566ea0e1e057217fb66083a56cc119ba" "q-275375/field-1/c7e2c99672184a6ffc5fe21255ac37862a4c27e4b225c7b645ba47d8f3c76eda"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275375/field-2/ab22b83e290700d204faf1095cfc25a4b648955dede5993efb51bc6a54cd3128" :answer/id #uuid "1ec873c9-23d3-58b5-8323-77f256645aae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275375/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "eee10c9a-70cb-5cc6-9585-6e3383379ff9" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275375/field-2/ab22b83e290700d204faf1095cfc25a4b648955dede5993efb51bc6a54cd3128" :answer-field/choices ["q-275375/field-2/ab22b83e290700d204faf1095cfc25a4b648955dede5993efb51bc6a54cd3128"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275375" :question/id #uuid "476d5ed3-04f5-5a62-90e6-9af09a1395e6" :question/math-academy-id "q-275375" :question/problem "Evaluate the expression below, expressing your answer in the form $a+b\\text{i},$ where $a$ and $b$ are real numbers.\n\n$\\frac{-4}{2-6\\text{i}}=($\n{{field-1}} \n$)\\,+\\,($\n{{field-2}}\n$)\\,\\text{i}$" :question/worked-solution "The denominator is $2-6\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $2+6\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $2+6\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-4}{2-6\\text{i}} & =\\frac{-4}{2-6\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{2+6\\text{i}}{2+6\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8-24\\text{i}}{4+12\\text{i}-12\\text{i}-36{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8-24\\text{i}}{4-36{\\text{i}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8-24\\text{i}}{4-(36)(-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8-24\\text{i}}{4+36} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8-24\\text{i}}{40}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-8-24\\text{i}}{40}=-\\frac{8}{40}-\\frac{24}{40}\\text{i}=(-\\frac{1}{5})+(-\\frac{3}{5})\\,\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-275375/field-1" "q-275375/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "678ba6cb-b259-5a25-858c-9db161a34ca9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-275375"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-74649/selection/6ad45083862dfc450ed98b1a2302ef954e9fe2b3391ee36d26e367a0b357d07e" :answer/id #uuid "7b107270-0473-5d03-996c-502821c6dcb6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{6}{5}-\\frac{8}{5}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74649/selection/ccc5f22103205ddd694e086cb760629566d93b3c89f9d725ac022ab07e69a3d5" :answer/id #uuid "2b46f602-afec-5743-9fc8-b77bdeb32b3e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{6}{5}+\\frac{3}{5}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74649/selection/fce2372ab02a2695261deb14b0590599c42078fcd83463bb58493476024257cc" :answer/id #uuid "f9346a76-0b1f-571a-a5a2-63a0a1cfa96d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{5}-\\frac{6}{5}\\text{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74649/selection/e29bb7d4a60ef119153387727b2654d0fa27fab283eb37edfe33d691178f4079" :answer/id #uuid "383b8013-c311-5906-9ac8-c50b6d26